dialect protocol
protocol stdio.xlsx.mutations
version 1
schema stdio.xlsx
start record

# FG-wave: REAL binary op frame (`format u8 | tag u8 | variant payload`), replacing F6's
# `print_op().into_bytes()` text-as-binary shortcut (`../../🦀️component.rs`'s old
# `OpBinary::encode_op`/`decode_op`); confirmed still on that shortcut live (not assumed) by
# direct read of this artifact's own file before this wave. `tag` is the `XlsxMutation` variant
# ordinal, in the SAME order `print_xlsx_mutation`'s own keyword match uses (`SetSnapshot`=1,
# `InsertSheet`=2, `RemoveSheet`=3, `RenameSheet`=4, `SetCell`=5, `RemoveCell`=6,
# `InsertSharedString`=7, `RemoveSharedString`=8, `SetSharedString`=9 -- `NoMutation` was dropped,
# ordinal 0 retired, not reassigned) -- both REAL fixed fields,
# individually protocol-walked, matching docx's own `🧬️mutations/💾️binary/📡️component.protocol.semio`
# `format`/`tag` header shape (this wave's OPC pattern-setter).
#
# Past that header, the variant's own payload is one opaque trailing `bytes` chain: `SetSnapshot`'s
# whole `XlsxSnapshot` (opc package + workbook) and `SetCell`'s direct `XlsxCellValue` payload
# (whose `Formula.cached` self-nests) both carry the SAME genuinely recursive/data-carrying shapes
# `../🔺️diff/💾️binary/📡️component.protocol.semio` already hits (`protocol-prim-ref-recursion`,
# `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §5) -- once ANY variant's payload is structurally unwalkable, bundling
# every variant's payload into the SAME opaque tail (rather than partially structuring only the
# simpler, flat-field variants) is the honest, minimal-surface choice, same reasoning docx's own
# file gives.
#
# The Rust `encode_op`/`decode_op` side stays genuinely, fully structured past this header -- real
# LEB128-varint-framed length-prefixed strings/bytes and recursive per-variant binary sub-encoders
# (`enc_xlsx_snapshot_bin`/`enc_opc_package_bin`/`enc_workbook_bin`/`enc_cell_value_bin`,
# `../../🦀️component.rs`'s own `OpBinaryCodec` region), reusing this artifact's
# `../🔺️diff/🦀️component.rs` `pub(crate)` binary primitives (`write_str_lp`/`write_bytes_lp`/
# `enc_part_bin`/`enc_rel_bin`/`enc_target_mode_bin`/`enc_sheet_bin`/`enc_cell_bin`/
# `enc_cell_value_bin`) rather than re-deriving them a second time -- round-trip tested
# independently of this protocol description, same honest-boundary treatment
# `📖️grammar-recipe.md` §2.5 documents.
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
chain payload bytes
